- **[38;5;10mabort()[0m cost 0.5s per call.** The host's [38;5;10mcore_pattern[0m pipes to [38;5;10msystemd-coredump[0m; the error-path sweeps would have taken ~18 minutes and looked like a hang. [38;5;10mprctl(PR_SET_DUMPABLE, 0)[0m in the forked child drops that to 0.7ms while leaving [38;5;10mWTERMSIG[0m intact. ([38;5;10mRLIMIT_CORE = 0[0m alone was not enough.)[0m[0m
